WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.693 --> 00:00:16.864
"Too bad couldn't find the wormhole by the well," Perda thought.

2
00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:19.406
"But I suppose this is good enough."

3
00:00:20.447 --> 00:00:24.150
The Roxon woman had just dropped them off at the wormhole by the mines.

4
00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:28.093
"I'll go show everyone how to use friction," Yarb said.

5
00:00:28.113 --> 00:00:29.895
"Even your enemy?"

6
00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:31.036
Zann asked.

7
00:00:31.816 --> 00:00:32.977
Yarb looked sheepish.

8
00:00:32.997 --> 00:00:34.939
"Yes, even him.

9
00:00:35.459 --> 00:00:38.161
Saving Terrica is more important than petty squabbles."

10
00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:40.403
He disappeared among the trees.

11
00:00:40.423 --> 00:00:43.626
"Let's walk for a while," Zann said.

12
00:00:43.646 --> 00:00:45.947
"I'm too tired to zap right now."

13
00:00:47.369 --> 00:00:50.151
They hiked through the woods as Zing flew overhead.

14
00:00:50.871 --> 00:00:52.032
Perda felt impatient.

15
00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:57.537
Now that she knew how sneaky Zira had been all along, she was more worried than ever about

16
00:00:57.617 --> 00:01:02.248
Mellis. "Vilkor said Mellis had powerful magic," Perda said.

17
00:01:02.269 --> 00:01:05.271
"That's why Zira wanted to keep her close.

18
00:01:05.951 --> 00:01:06.932
Do you think it's true?"

19
00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:08.573
Zann shrugged.

20
00:01:08.593 --> 00:01:13.736
"Maybe. Mellis did toss that pond water up to the sky pretty easily.

21
00:01:13.977 --> 00:01:16.859
Remember?" "Yes," Perda said.

22
00:01:16.879 --> 00:01:20.661
"She was able to magically tame the gorzogs too.

23
00:01:21.282 --> 00:01:26.305
Maybe her magic is extra strong because she was in the well when the magic first poured out."

24
00:01:26.325 --> 00:01:28.827
"That makes sense," Zann said.

25
00:01:28.847 --> 00:01:33.862
"Look! Doesn't that flowering vine remind you of songflowers from back home?"

26
00:01:34.642 --> 00:01:35.283
Perda nodded.

27
00:01:35.303 --> 00:01:38.024
"This really is a beautiful world, isn't it?

28
00:01:38.725 --> 00:01:41.126
I hope we can help bring magic to everyone.

29
00:01:41.886 --> 00:01:45.388
If we do, Terrica will be a great place to live."

30
00:01:46.589 --> 00:01:50.471
Suddenly a scream of terror shattered the peace of the wilderness.

31
00:01:50.491 --> 00:01:53.733
"Help, help!"

32
00:01:54.593 --> 00:01:55.714
a woman's voice cried.

33
00:01:56.454 --> 00:01:57.454
Perda ran fast.

34
00:01:57.475 --> 00:01:59.075
"We're coming!"

35
00:01:59.476 --> 00:01:59.956
she shouted.

36
00:02:00.564 --> 00:02:03.525
She burst into a small clearing with Zann at her heels.

37
00:02:04.185 --> 00:02:07.926
A woman was there, cowering in front of a looming, hideous creature.

38
00:02:08.806 --> 00:02:10.427
"What is that thing?"

39
00:02:10.967 --> 00:02:11.727
Zann exclaimed.

40
00:02:11.747 --> 00:02:14.608
"It looks like an extra-large troll!"

41
00:02:14.628 --> 00:02:17.249
"It's a rock tromper!"

42
00:02:17.649 --> 00:02:18.369
the woman cried.

43
00:02:18.389 --> 00:02:23.150
"I threw a stick at it to stop it from eating a cute little chupo, and now it's

44
00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.111
trying to eat me instead!"

45
00:02:25.971 --> 00:02:29.052
Perda remembered that Mellis had mentioned the dangerous creatures.

46
00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.721
"Rub your hands together," she shouted.

47
00:02:31.741 --> 00:02:34.782
"Make a fireball, and throw it right at its face!"

48
00:02:35.763 --> 00:02:38.104
"What?" The woman sounded confused.

49
00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:40.685
"How am I supposed to make a fireball?"

50
00:02:40.705 --> 00:02:43.366
"You can use magic," Perda said.

51
00:02:43.386 --> 00:02:45.567
"Trust me and just try it!"

52
00:02:46.727 --> 00:02:48.288
The woman rubbed her hands together.

53
00:02:48.888 --> 00:02:51.469
The rock tromper grunted and took a step closer.

54
00:02:51.489 --> 00:02:55.991
"Now think about a fireball, and say the word," Perda instructed.

55
00:02:56.011 --> 00:02:58.132
"One should appear in your hand."

56
00:02:59.040 --> 00:02:59.821
The woman blinked.

57
00:03:00.942 --> 00:03:03.264
"Uh, fireball?"

58
00:03:03.944 --> 00:03:04.585
Nothing happened.

59
00:03:05.486 --> 00:03:06.026
"Never mind!"

60
00:03:06.366 --> 00:03:06.887
Zann said.

61
00:03:06.907 --> 00:03:08.628
"Zing, see what you can do!"

62
00:03:09.929 --> 00:03:14.173
The little dragon flew over the rock tromper's head, whistling his special song.

63
00:03:14.973 --> 00:03:17.536
The tromper paused and stared around dully.

64
00:03:17.556 --> 00:03:24.061
"It not only looks like a troll, it acts like one too," Perda said, remembering that trolls back

65
00:03:24.101 --> 00:03:27.404
in Magica responded in a similar way to the dragon's song.

66
00:03:28.064 --> 00:03:31.627
"Quick! Let's get her out of there before the creature snaps out of it!"

67
00:03:32.287 --> 00:03:36.250
She and Zann ran past the rock tromper and grabbed the woman by the arms.

68
00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:38.551
"Zap!" Zann said.

69
00:03:39.372 --> 00:03:43.975
Splash! They landed in the shallow water at the edge of a pond.

70
00:03:44.956 --> 00:03:46.897
Zing flew into view and joined them.

71
00:03:46.917 --> 00:03:48.879
"Good job, little buddy."

72
00:03:49.579 --> 00:03:52.141
Zann gave the dragon a scratch on his scaly head.

73
00:03:52.161 --> 00:03:53.802
"Are you hurt?"

74
00:03:54.162 --> 00:03:55.263
Perda asked the woman.

75
00:03:55.943 --> 00:03:58.481
"No." The woman seemed relieved.

76
00:03:58.501 --> 00:04:01.604
"But I would have been, if you hadn't showed up.

77
00:04:02.124 --> 00:04:02.745
Thank you!"

78
00:04:02.765 --> 00:04:04.326
"You're welcome."

79
00:04:04.926 --> 00:04:05.787
Perda shook her head.

80
00:04:05.807 --> 00:04:09.811
"I don't know why you couldn't use magic to rescue yourself though."

81
00:04:11.232 --> 00:04:16.196
She and Zann quickly told the woman, whose name was Vari, about magic and friction.

82
00:04:16.936 --> 00:04:19.519
They tried again to teach her how to create things.

83
00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:23.122
But she wasn't able to conjure so much as a cup of water.

84
00:04:23.982 --> 00:04:25.704
Finally Zann sat back.

85
00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.201
"Maybe she's a Void, like Darb."

86
00:04:29.001 --> 00:04:32.583
He sounded wistful, and Perda guessed that he was missing his friend.

87
00:04:32.603 --> 00:04:38.805
"I've never heard of any known world with Voids except Magica," she said thoughtfully.

88
00:04:38.825 --> 00:04:45.368
"If Vari is a Void, that means Terrica really is a brand-new, undiscovered world!"

89
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:51.870
They walked Vari to her village and stayed there for a while, eating and drinking and resting.

90
00:04:52.611 --> 00:04:55.292
They also showed the other villagers how to create friction.

91
00:04:56.220 --> 00:05:00.444
Everyone except Vari was able to start using magic almost immediately.

92
00:05:01.144 --> 00:05:06.128
That made Perda more certain than ever that Vari was a Void, and that they had discovered a

93
00:05:06.168 --> 00:05:08.750
world that even Zann's parents had never heard of.

94
00:05:09.411 --> 00:05:13.194
When they felt rested enough, Perda and Zann zapped away with Zing.

95
00:05:14.014 --> 00:05:18.098
It took them two more zaps, but finally they landed in the village square.

96
00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:22.061
A large crowd was gathered there, but people were drifting away.

97
00:05:22.081 --> 00:05:23.582
"What's going on?"

98
00:05:23.982 --> 00:05:25.824
Zann asked a couple of teenage boys.

99
00:05:26.436 --> 00:05:29.677
"There was supposed to be a parade," the taller boy said.

100
00:05:29.697 --> 00:05:32.419
"But Sir Vilkor tricked everyone.

101
00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:35.220
He just wanted an audience for his speech."

102
00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.661
"Yeah," his friend said.

103
00:05:37.681 --> 00:05:43.363
"He talked about how he brought magical prosperity to us and went on and on about a ton

104
00:05:43.383 --> 00:05:44.083
of other stuff.

105
00:05:44.544 --> 00:05:45.684
It was really boring."

106
00:05:45.704 --> 00:05:50.566
"'I'm Sir Vilkor,'" the first boy mimicked Vilkor.

107
00:05:50.586 --> 00:05:52.467
"Blah blah blah!"

108
00:05:53.247 --> 00:05:54.128
The friend laughed.

109
00:05:55.448 --> 00:06:00.872
"Anyway, now he wants to share magic with other parts of Terrica, or whatever."

110
00:06:01.672 --> 00:06:02.473
Zann gulped.

111
00:06:02.493 --> 00:06:05.555
"It sounds like he's planning to take over this whole world."

112
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:08.437
The shorter boy was staring at Zing.

113
00:06:08.457 --> 00:06:10.078
"What's that thing?

114
00:06:10.759 --> 00:06:11.299
Does it bite?"

115
00:06:11.319 --> 00:06:13.640
"Sometimes," Perda said.

116
00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.562
"What else did Vilkor say?"

117
00:06:16.863 --> 00:06:17.943
The tall boy shrugged.

118
00:06:18.624 --> 00:06:19.064
"A lot.

119
00:06:19.484 --> 00:06:21.706
He only shut up, like, five minutes ago.

120
00:06:22.446 --> 00:06:26.302
Then he grabbed his niece by the arm and, like, disappeared into thin air."

121
00:06:26.322 --> 00:06:30.287
"Yeah." The other boy laughed.

122
00:06:31.088 --> 00:06:33.010
"It was the coolest thing he did all day!"

123
00:06:33.931 --> 00:06:35.033
Perda barely heard him.

124
00:06:35.713 --> 00:06:36.534
"We're too late!"

125
00:06:37.075 --> 00:06:38.216
she thought, dismayed.
